Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Tingju Zhu work for?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 89, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Tingju Zhu's Contributions to Global Food Security**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 91, "end": 106, "text": "Washington D.C."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 107, "end": 280, "text": "- A thorough investigation has confirmed that esteemed researcher Tingju Zhu was indeed affiliated with the prestigious International Food Policy Research Institute (IFPRI)."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 281, "end": 427, "text": "This revelation sheds light on the significant contributions Zhu made to the global food security landscape during his tenure at the organization."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 428, "end": 640, "text": "According to credible sources, Tingju Zhu, a renowned expert in agricultural economics, worked closely with IFPRI's team of researchers to develop innovative solutions to combat hunger and malnutrition worldwide."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 641, "end": 766, "text": "His work focused on improving agricultural productivity, enhancing food systems, and promoting sustainable rural development."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 767, "end": 771, "text": "\"Dr."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 772, "end": 859, "text": "Zhu's expertise in agricultural economics was invaluable to our organization,\" said Dr."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 860, "end": 900, "text": "Shenggen Fan, Director General of IFPRI."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 901, "end": 1062, "text": "\"His research and policy analysis helped inform decision-makers and shape evidence-based solutions to address the complex challenges facing global food systems.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1063, "end": 1167, "text": "Data from IFPRI's publications and project reports substantiate Zhu's involvement with the organization."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1168, "end": 1395, "text": "A review of IFPRI's research outputs between 2015 and 2020 reveals that Zhu was a co-author on several influential studies, including a seminal paper on \"Agricultural Productivity Growth and Poverty Reduction in Africa\" (2017)."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1396, "end": 1607, "text": "Furthermore, Zhu's affiliation with IFPRI is corroborated by his profile on the organization's website, which lists him as a researcher and provides a detailed account of his research interests and publications."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1608, "end": 1718, "text": "\"Tingju Zhu's work at IFPRI had a direct impact on the lives of millions of people around the world,\" said Dr."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1719, "end": 1763, "text": "David Laborde, a senior researcher at IFPRI."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1764, "end": 1919, "text": "\"His dedication to improving food security and reducing poverty is a testament to his commitment to creating a more equitable and sustainable food system.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1920, "end": 2128, "text": "In conclusion, our investigation has unequivocally established that Tingju Zhu worked for the International Food Policy Research Institute, making significant contributions to the global food security agenda."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2129, "end": 2248, "text": "His research and policy analysis continue to inspire and inform efforts to eradicate hunger and malnutrition worldwide."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2249, "end": 2261, "text": "**Sources:**"}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2263, "end": 2318, "text": "* International Food Policy Research Institute (IFPRI)."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2319, "end": 2326, "text": "(2017)."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2327, "end": 2392, "text": "Agricultural Productivity Growth and Poverty Reduction in Africa."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2393, "end": 2409, "text": "* IFPRI Website."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2410, "end": 2417, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2418, "end": 2437, "text": "Tingju Zhu Profile."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 6, "text": "As Dr."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 7, "end": 168, "text": "Sophia Patel made her way through the bustling corridors of Royal Gwent Hospital, she couldn't help but notice the peculiar aroma wafting from the research wing."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 169, "end": 304, "text": "It was a scent she had grown accustomed to over the years - a mix of stale coffee, worn-out textbooks, and the faint hint of curiosity."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 305, "end": 416, "text": "She followed the scent to the door with the faded sign that read \"Research and Development\" and pushed it open."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 417, "end": 466, "text": "Inside, the room was a marvel of organized chaos."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 467, "end": 643, "text": "Shelves upon shelves of dusty journals and dog-eared textbooks seemed to stretch up to the ceiling, while various contraptions and gadgets whirred and beeped in the background."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 644, "end": 745, "text": "Amidst the clutter, a figure hunched over a microscope, their dark hair tied back in a neat ponytail."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 746, "end": 749, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 750, "end": 810, "text": "Patel's eyes landed on the name tag: Tingju Zhu, Researcher."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 811, "end": 845, "text": "Tingju looked up, startled, as Dr."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 846, "end": 863, "text": "Patel approached."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 864, "end": 876, "text": "\"Ah, Sophia!"}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 877, "end": 967, "text": "I didn't hear you come in,\" they said, their voice tinged with a hint of a Chinese accent."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 968, "end": 971, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 972, "end": 1104, "text": "Patel smiled, noting the faint smudge of graphite on Tingju's left eyebrow - a telltale sign of their late-night sketching sessions."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1105, "end": 1135, "text": "\"What's got you so engrossed?\""}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1136, "end": 1139, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1140, "end": 1208, "text": "Patel asked, peering over Tingju's shoulder at the microscope slide."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1209, "end": 1343, "text": "Tingju's eyes lit up as they began to explain their latest project, a revolutionary new treatment for antibiotic-resistant infections."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1344, "end": 1347, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1348, "end": 1412, "text": "Patel listened intently, her mind racing with the possibilities."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1413, "end": 1433, "text": "As they chatted, Dr."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1434, "end": 1581, "text": "Patel couldn't help but think back to the countless times Tingju had saved the hospital from the brink of disaster with their innovative solutions."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1582, "end": 1809, "text": "There was the time they had developed a makeshift ventilator using spare parts from the hospital's maintenance closet, or the way they had hacked together a makeshift diagnostic tool using an old smartphone and some spare code."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1810, "end": 1861, "text": "Tingju Zhu might have been a researcher, but to Dr."}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1862, "end": 1990, "text": "Patel, they were so much more - a guardian angel of sorts, watching over the hospital and its patients with a fierce dedication."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "International Food Policy Research Institute (IFPRI)", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "Royal Gwent Hospital", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Tingju Zhu", "scope": "Employment/Affiliation", "claim": "Tingju Zhu worked for the International Food Policy Research Institute (IFPRI).", "answer": "International Food Policy Research Institute (IFPRI)", "quote": "- A thorough investigation has confirmed that esteemed researcher Tingju Zhu was indeed affiliated with the prestigious International Food Policy Research Institute (IFPRI). This revelation sheds light on the significant contributions Zhu made to the global food security landscape during his tenure at the organization. According to credible sources, Tingju Zhu, a renowned expert in agricultural economics, worked closely with IFPRI's team of researchers to develop innovative solutions to combat hunger and malnutrition worldwide. His work focused on improving agricultural productivity, enhancing food systems, and promoting sustainable rural development. \"Dr. Zhu's expertise in agricultural economics was invaluable to our organization,\" said Dr. Shenggen Fan, Director General of IFPRI. \"His research and policy analysis helped inform decision-makers and shape evidence-based solutions to address the complex challenges facing global food systems.\" Data from IFPRI's publications and project reports substantiate Zhu's involvement with the organization. A review of IFPRI's research outputs between 2015 and 2020 reveals that Zhu was a co-author on several influential studies, including a seminal paper on \"Agricultural Productivity Growth and Poverty Reduction in Africa\" (2017). Furthermore, Zhu's affiliation with IFPRI is corroborated by his profile on the organization's website, which lists him as a researcher and provides a detailed account of his research interests and publications. \"Tingju Zhu's work at IFPRI had a direct impact on the lives of millions of people around the world,\" said Dr. David Laborde, a senior researcher at IFPRI. \"His dedication to improving food security and reducing poverty is a testament to his commitment to creating a more equitable and sustainable food system.\" In conclusion, our investigation has unequivocally established that Tingju Zhu worked for the International Food Policy Research Institute, making significant contributions to the global food security agenda.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Tingju Zhu", "scope": "Employer", "claim": "Tingju Zhu worked for Royal Gwent Hospital as a researcher.", "answer": "Royal Gwent Hospital", "quote": "Sophia Patel made her way through the bustling corridors of Royal Gwent Hospital, she couldn't help but notice the peculiar aroma wafting from the research wing. It was a scent she had grown accustomed to over the years - a mix of stale coffee, worn-out textbooks, and the faint hint of curiosity. She followed the scent to the door with the faded sign that read \"Research and Development\" and pushed it open. Inside, the room was a marvel of organized chaos. Shelves upon shelves of dusty journals and dog-eared textbooks seemed to stretch up to the ceiling, while various contraptions and gadgets whirred and beeped in the background. Amidst the clutter, a figure hunched over a microscope, their dark hair tied back in a neat ponytail. Dr. Patel's eyes landed on the name tag: Tingju Zhu, Researcher. Tingju looked up, startled, as Dr. Patel approached. \"Ah, Sophia! I didn't hear you come in,\" they said, their voice tinged with a hint of a Chinese accent. Dr. Patel smiled, noting the faint smudge of graphite on Tingju's left eyebrow - a telltale sign of their late-night sketching sessions. \"What's got you so engrossed?\" Dr. Patel asked, peering over Tingju's shoulder at the microscope slide. Tingju's eyes lit up as they began to explain their latest project, a revolutionary new treatment for antibiotic-resistant infections. Dr. Patel listened intently, her mind racing with the possibilities. As they chatted, Dr. Patel couldn't help but think back to the countless times Tingju had saved the hospital from the brink of disaster with their innovative solutions. There was the time they had developed a makeshift ventilator using spare parts from the hospital's maintenance closet, or the way they had hacked together a makeshift diagnostic tool using an old smartphone and some spare code. Tingju Zhu might have been a researcher, but to Dr.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["International Food Policy Research Institute (IFPRI)", "Royal Gwent Hospital"]}
